# Unreal Engine generated directories
Binaries/
Build/
DerivedDataCache/
LocalDerivedDataCache/
Intermediate/
Script/

# Ignore Saved output except the shared UBT Git working-set safeguard
Saved/*
!Saved/UnrealBuildTool/
Saved/UnrealBuildTool/*
!Saved/UnrealBuildTool/BuildConfiguration.xml

# Visual Studio
.vs/
*.sln
*.slnx
*.suo
*.sdf
*.opensdf
*.VC.db
*.VC.VC.opendb
*.user
*.userosscache

# JetBrains Rider
.idea/
*.sln.DotSettings.user
*.DotSettings.user

# Other editors and generated project files
.vscode/
*.code-workspace
compile_commands.json
.clangd
.cache/

# Local diagnostics and temporary files
*.log
*.tmp
*.temp
*.bak
*.orig
*.userprefs

# Operating system files
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini
.DS_Store

# 第三方插件：DreamShader / DreamFX 各自是独立 git 仓库（fork 自 TypeDreamMoon），
# 不要塞进本仓库；需要时按 Plugins/AtlasFX/DESIGN.md §11 的地址重新 clone
/Plugins/DreamShader/
/Plugins/DreamFX/

# DreamShader 的反编译镜像：`dsc.ps1 decompile` 的产物，
# 会被自动编译成 /Game/Decompiled/... 下的临时资产，不是源文件
DShader/Decompiled/
Content/Decompiled/
